(((where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "Get-ChildItem") AND where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS " -Recurse ") AND where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS " -Include "))) AND ((where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".doc") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".docx") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".xls") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".xlsx") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".ppt") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".pptx") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".rtf") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".pdf") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS ".txt"))))
